{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28815","headline":"游维山新兴寺宿石屏村谢叟家 · 许浑","name":"游维山新兴寺宿石屏村谢叟家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚过石屏村，村长日渐曛。\n僧归下岭见，人语隔溪闻。\n谷响寒耕雪，山明夜烧云。\n家家扣铜鼓，欲赛鲁将军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「游维山新兴寺宿石屏村谢叟家」条，撰者黄全彦、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"黄全彦"}